      "category": "Text",
      "text": "1. New York City Civil Service Commission Medical and Physical Standards for Applicants for the position of Motor Vehicle Operator. The public announcement for the position will describe the medical tests, standards, and causes for rejection for the position of Motor Vehicle Operator. The advertisement will include a statement that periodic medical examinations will be given after appointment. Candidates who pass the Department of Personnel screening medical examination will be certified to fill Motor Vehicle Operator positions.",
